# Runs of variants on the Cheats screen (source/screens/cheats.c,
# docs/plans/cheat-variants-run-once.md) over tests/shots/data/choices.cht:
# the four "Wild Pokemon - ..." cheats fold into one row named by what their
# names share, its pick's own part at its right, and Max money and No money
# into one named by its first, with its count (list); on the run's row A
# opens it (run); its choices by their own parts, the cursor on the pick,
# the run's name in the title (choices); A on another picks it and drops
# the old pick (picked); B back on the run's row, its new pick at its right
# (back); the money run opened: "Pick one" in the title (pickone).
#! settings 28=1
#! sd-file /torii/cheats/Hello.cht 0 tests/shots/data/choices.cht
# The tests' hook: lists open on their first row (else a list opens on
# Hello, the game Recent played last)
-p 30:nav_test_action:2113929225
-w "nav: test hook 9 "
-w "nav: home ready"
-k @8:RIGHT -k @12:-
-k @20:A -k @24:-
-w "nav: page gba ready"
-k @8:RIGHT -k @12:- -k @20:RIGHT -k @24:- -k @32:RIGHT -k @36:-
-k @80:START -k @84:-
-w "screen ready: game-popup"
-k @12:DOWN -k @16:- -k @24:DOWN -k @28:-
-k @48:A -k @52:-
-w "screen ready: cheats"
-s @8:list.png
-k @16:DOWN -k @20:-
-s @32:run.png
-k @40:A -k @44:-
-s @64:choices.png
-k @72:DOWN -k @76:- -k @84:A -k @88:-
-s @104:picked.png
-k @112:B -k @118:-
-s @140:back.png
-k @148:DOWN -k @152:- -k @160:A -k @164:-
-s @188:pickone.png
